# Klipper `make menuconfig` selections for klipper-v0's RP2040 boards —
# used for BOTH the main SKR Pico (`[mcu]`) and the LDO Picobilical
# toolhead board (`[mcu umb]`). Same chip, same firmware build; only
# the flash target (FLASH_DEVICE serial path) differs between them.
# Copy to ~/klipper/.config, then `make olddefconfig && make`, then
# `make flash FLASH_DEVICE=<serial path>` once per board. See
# README.md "Upgrading Klipper firmware" for the full procedure.
CONFIG_LOW_LEVEL_OPTIONS=y
CONFIG_MACH_RPXXXX=y
CONFIG_MACH_RP2040=y
CONFIG_RPXXXX_FLASH_START_0100=y
CONFIG_RP2040_FLASH_W25Q080=y
